      <p style="margin:0; color:var(--fg-2);">
        The app currently runs on stock daisyUI themes: the brand CSS
        (<code>daisy-override.css</code>, <code>assets/themes/*.css</code>) is
        <strong>not imported by any entry point</strong>. This playbook is the target state, and
