    </div>
    <p class="ramp-note">One primary button per region. Icon-only buttons are 32×32 minimum (44×44 on mobile) and
      require <code>aria-label</code>. Toolbars use <code>btn btn-ghost btn-sm</code> uniformly — never the default padding.</p>

    <h3 style="margin:24px 0 8px;">Inputs</h3>
    <div class="grid g2" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
      <div class="demo">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="i1">Board name</label>
          <input class="input" id="i1" placeholder="Sprint 12">
          <span class="hint">Sentence case. Names are user-defined.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="i2">Model</label>
          <input class="input" id="i2" value="claude-sonnet-4-5" style="font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:13px;">
