  <!-- ══ Do / Don't ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="dodont">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="num">13</span><h2>Do / Don't</h2></div>
    <p class="sub">The seven mistakes that were actually found in the codebase, as pairs.</p>

    <div class="pair">
      <div class="do"><div class="h">✓ Do</div><div class="body">Use <code>#CC0099</code> for magenta and <code>#FF69B4</code> for magenta <em>text</em> on dark. One value per role.</div></div>
      <div class="dont"><div class="h">✕ Don't</div><div class="body">Introduce <code>#CC049C</code> (a 3/255 near-miss) or resurrect <code>#6366F1</code> indigo. Three palettes is how "brand colour" stops being a value.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pair">
      <div class="do"><div class="h">✓ Do</div><div class="body">Keep <code>radius.field</code> / <code>radius.box</code> / <code>radius.selector</code>. One radius per component.</div></div>
      <div class="dont"><div class="h">✕ Don't</div><div class="body">Mix 12px body + 8px header + pill button in one card. It reads as three objects.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pair">
      <div class="do"><div class="h">✓ Do</div><div class="body">Show every number with a unit and, in a column, tabular figures. <code>12.4k tokens</code> · <code>$0.42</code> · <code>2m 12s</code>.</div></div>
      <div class="dont"><div class="h">✕ Don't</div><div class="body">Write <code>12.4k</code>, <code>0.42</code>, <code>132 seconds</code> — or a UI string with no unit at all.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pair">
      <div class="do"><div class="h">✓ Do</div><div class="body">Pair status colour with a word or icon: <span class="badge success"><span class="dot on"></span>online</span></div></div>
      <div class="dont"><div class="h">✕ Don't</div><div class="body">Use a bare green dot, a red border, or a magenta element to mean "error".</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pair">
      <div class="do"><div class="h">✓ Do</div><div class="body">Use <code>fa-solid</code> for UI chrome, <code>fa-regular</code> for soft nav and empty states — one set per surface.</div></div>
      <div class="dont"><div class="h">✕ Don't</div><div class="body">Mix Font Awesome and Iconify in one view; use emoji as UI icons; reuse <code>fa-comments</code> for both Chat and Messenger.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pair">
      <div class="do"><div class="h">✓ Do</div><div class="body">Design the panel <em>and</em> the route; give multi-instance apps a qualified title (<code>Tasks — Sprint 12</code>).</div></div>
      <div class="dont"><div class="h">✕ Don't</div><div class="body">Ship a screen that only works with a 256px sidebar next to it — on mobile it becomes a headless page.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pair" style="margin-bottom:0;">
      <div class="do"><div class="h">✓ Do</div><div class="body">Write the error: <em>what failed · why · what to do next</em>, then keep the panel open.</div></div>
      <div class="dont"><div class="h">✕ Don't</div><div class="body">"Something went wrong." · "Error: [object Object]" · "Oops! 😢"</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ Roadmap ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="roadmap">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="num">14</span><h2>Roadmap</h2></div>
    <p class="sub">Sequenced so each phase removes a class of future inconsistency. S ≤ 2 days · M ≤ 1 week · L &gt; 1 week (one frontend).</p>
    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th style="width:52px;">Phase</th><th>Content</th><th style="width:96px;">Effort</th><th style="width:110px;">Status</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>0</td><td>Stop the drift: delete dead brand CSS + Vue logo, fix <code>@font-face</code>, retire indigo, CI hex guard</td><td>≈3 days</td><td><span class="chip ok">ready</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>1</td><td>Tokens live: <code>tokens.css</code>, two daisyUI themes, per-theme primary, restrict the theme selector</td><td>≈1 week</td><td><span class="chip ok">ready</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>2</td><td>Corporate image: vector logo + variants, favicon/PWA/OG, sidebar lockup, re-shoot screenshots, deck templates</td><td>≈2 weeks</td><td><span class="chip warn">blocked</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>3</td><td>Components: modal focus trap + <code>z-160</code>, shared <code>DataTable</code>, button/input/badge recipes, handover banner, chat spec, empty states, local avatars</td><td>≈3 weeks</td><td><span class="chip">queued</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>4</td><td>UX debt: one "Everything" launcher for both shells, one navigation model, keyboard operation for boards, <code>aria-live</code> streaming</td><td>≈2 weeks</td><td><span class="chip">queued</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>5</td><td>Governance: design review in the PR template, published accessibility statement, published design system, quarterly brand audit</td><td>ongoing</td><td><span class="chip">queued</span></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h3 style="margin:20px 0 8px;">Metrics that tell you it is working</h3>
    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Baseline</th><th>Target</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Distinct brand palettes in the repo</td><td>3</td><td><strong>1</strong></td></tr>
          <tr><td>daisyUI themes offered to users</td><td>35</td><td><strong>2</strong></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Raw hex literals outside <code>tokens.css</code></td><td>many</td><td><strong>0</strong></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Contrast failures on primary screens</td><td>≥ 1</td><td><strong>0</strong></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Lighthouse accessibility (Home / Chat / Board)</td><td>unknown</td><td><strong>≥ 90</strong></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h3 style="margin:20px 0 8px;">Open decisions — they need a human, not more analysis</h3>
    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th style="width:40px;">#</th><th>Decision</th><th>Blocks</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>1</td><td>Logo: glyph + wordmark, <em>or</em> typographic-only (magenta hyphen as the mark)?</td><td>All of Phase 2</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2</td><td>Adopt a licensed webfont for marketing/headings, or stay 100% system?</td><td>Typography §2</td></tr>
          <tr><td>3</td><td>Tablets (641–1024px): keep the mobile shell, or build a compact desktop?</td><td>IA + layout rules</td></tr>
          <tr><td>4</td><td>Is <code>codx-junior-light</code> a supported theme or a convenience?</td><td>Colour work, QA matrix</td></tr>
          <tr><td>5</td><td>Do profiles get individual avatars as part of the brand system?</td><td>Asset set</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

