            <code>api/projects/projects.py</code> and a test.
          </div>
          <div class="meta"><span>codx-junior</span>·<span>software_developer</span>·<span class="mono">claude-sonnet-4-5</span>·<span class="mono">1,204 tok</span>·<span class="mono">$0.03</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chatrow">
        <div class="avatar me">AL</div>
        <div>
          <div class="bubble me">Do it, and run the full test suite after.</div>
          <div class="meta"><span>you</span>·<span>2m 12s ago</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chatrow" style="margin-bottom:0;">
        <div class="avatar ai">◆</div>
        <div><div class="bubble ai">Running tests… 3 of 12 <span class="cursor"></span></div></div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin:12px 0 0; font-size:12px; color:var(--fg-2);">
        Bubbles max 800px · AI bubble <code>surface.raised</code> + 2px <code>primary/30</code> left border ·
        human bubble <code>primary/10</code>. The distinction never relies on colour alone (border + avatar + label).
        No entrance animation while streaming — a single 2px cursor at the tail.
